__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/RESUME.md

# Derived legacy-corpus manifests: regeneratable via legacy/classify.py,
# but contain full filesystem paths from outside this repo that reveal
# unrelated private project names/structure. Excluded from tracking for
# public release safety -- see legacy/DECISION_PACKET.md.
legacy/manifests/*.json

# foundation/cron_pulse.py's real, live, hourly output on this machine --
# machine-local runtime state/receipts, not source. Regenerates on its
# own; a fresh clone correctly reports these logs as "never fired yet"
# (foundation/sentinel.py::read_pulse_continuity(),
# foundation/mouth_common.py::read_mouth_log_continuity()) until its own
# cron entry runs.
foundation/pulse_log.jsonl
foundation/mouth_*_log.jsonl
foundation/mouth_*_state.json
foundation/dependency_pressure_log.jsonl
foundation/cron_pulse.err.log
